    <bpmn:process id="W_W3908" name="W3908. New-Product Introduction (NPI) &amp; Phase-In/Phase-Out Forecasting" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: NPI (links to VS-01.1); SKU lifecycle event
Frequency: Per NPI/phase-out + monthly review
Volume: ~5–8% annual SKU growth (~1,500–2,500 new SKUs/yr, the corpus canon); seasonal intros
Owner: Demand Planning / Merchandising
Participants: Demand Planning, Merchandising/Category (links to VS-01), Supply (links to VS-02), Sourcing (links to VS-03/VS-122), Marketing (links to VS-14), Quality (links to VS-31), Store Ops/Space (links to VS-55/VS-07), Insights (links to VS-28.1)
Source: workflow W3908 — New-Product Introduction (NPI) &amp; Phase-In/Phase-Out Forecasting</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3908_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3908_Lane1" name="Demand Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3908_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3908_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3908_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3908_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3908_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3908_Start3" name="NPI (links to VS-01.1); SKU lifecycle event">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3908_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
