      <bpmn:userTask id="W3908_Task4" name="Demand Planning/Merchandising forecast new-product demand using like-item…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Demand Planning/Merchandising forecast new-product demand using like-item modeling, market/competitive intelligence (links to VS-57), and launch curves; set initial allocation/store coverage (links to VS-01.1/VS-55) and the phase-in ramp over the horizon
Responsible (R): Demand Planning / Merchandising / Insights
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead / VP Merchandising
Duration: Per NPI</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3908_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3908_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3908_Task5" name="Demand Planning/Merchandising manage phase-out/end-of-life for discontinuing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Demand Planning/Merchandising manage phase-out/end-of-life for discontinuing SKUs (links to VS-64 seasonal clearance): sell-down plan, inventory-burn target, substitute/cross-sell mapping, and final clearance (links to VS-05.3/VS-64) to avoid obsolete stock
Responsible (R): Demand Planning / Merchandising / Supply
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Per phase-out</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3908_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3908_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3908_Task6" name="Demand Planning track NPI forecast vs actual and feed launch-learning back into…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Demand Planning track NPI forecast vs actual and feed launch-learning back into like-item models (links to W3911), and refresh the active-SKU base for the next cycle
Responsible (R): Demand Planning / Insights
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3908_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3908_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
