    <bpmn:process id="W_W3911" name="W3911. Forecast Accuracy Measurement &amp; Bias Correction" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close; accuracy cycle
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Accuracy KPIs across category/region/SKU-family
Owner: Demand Planning / Insights
Participants: Demand Planning, Insights (links to VS-28.1), Data Science (links to VS-30.2), Merchandising (links to VS-01), Supply (links to VS-02), Finance (links to VS-17.4), S&amp;OP Lead
Source: workflow W3911 — Forecast Accuracy Measurement &amp; Bias Correction</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3911_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3911_Lane1" name="Demand Planning">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3911_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3911_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3911_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3911_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3911_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
