        <bpmn:outgoing>W3911_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3911_Task4" name="Demand Planning/Insights measure forecast accuracy (MAPE/WMAPE/Bias) by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Demand Planning/Insights measure forecast accuracy (MAPE/WMAPE/Bias) by category/region/SKU-family and horizon, segmented by treatment (A/B/C), source (statistical vs override), and event vs steady-state
Responsible (R): Demand Planning / Insights
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3911_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3911_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3911_Task5" name="Demand Planning identify persistent bias (over/under) by forecaster/category…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Demand Planning identify persistent bias (over/under) by forecaster/category, run root-cause (model gap, override bias, regime change), and apply correction (model retrain, override coaching, parameter tuning — links to VS-30.2)
Responsible (R): Demand Planning / Data Science
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3911_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3911_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3911_Task6" name="Demand Planning publish the forecast-accuracy scorecard to the S&amp;OP cycle…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Demand Planning publish the forecast-accuracy scorecard to the S&amp;OP cycle (links to W3919/W3925) and track improvement vs the accuracy target
Responsible (R): Demand Planning
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3911_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3911_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
