        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-610 (ensure controlled execution — S&amp;OP/IBP Framework, Demand Consensus &amp; Forecasting (PA-127.1).) | - operational: bias tracking and correction; operational: multi-metric scorecard
Owner: Demand Planning / Insights</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
