    <bpmn:process id="W_W3912" name="W3912. Constrained Demand Plan &amp; Gap-to-Target Analysis" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Consensus demand (W3907); target review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: Gap analysis vs revenue/margin/service/turn targets
Owner: S&amp;OP / Demand Planning
Participants: S&amp;OP Lead, Merchandising (links to VS-01), Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4/VS-101), Supply (links to VS-02), Marketing (links to VS-14), Strategy (links to VS-33), Trade (links to VS-11/VS-107)
Source: workflow W3912 — Constrained Demand Plan &amp; Gap-to-Target Analysis</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3912_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3912_Lane1" name="S&amp;OP Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3912_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3912_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3912_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3912_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3912_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3912_Start3" name="Consensus demand (W3907); target review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3912_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3912_Task4" name="S&amp;OP compare the unconstrained consensus demand (links to W3907) to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: S&amp;OP compare the unconstrained consensus demand (links to W3907) to financial/strategic targets (revenue/margin links to VS-101/VS-33, service level, turn target links to profile §12.3) and quantify the gap
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead / Finance / Merchandising
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3912_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3912_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3912_Task5" name="S&amp;OP identify gap-closing levers: demand-shaping (promo links to W3909, pricing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: S&amp;OP identify gap-closing levers: demand-shaping (promo links to W3909, pricing links to VS-01.2), supply acceleration (sourcing links to VS-122, expedites), inventory re-balancing (links to VS-02), and trade/key-account pipeline (links to VS-107)
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead / Functions
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3912_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3912_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3912_Task6" name="S&amp;OP escalate unresolvable gaps to pre-S&amp;OP/exec S&amp;OP (links to W3916/W3919)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: S&amp;OP escalate unresolvable gaps to pre-S&amp;OP/exec S&amp;OP (links to W3916/W3919) for decision (accept gap, invest, re-sequence), with documented options and financial impact
Responsible (R): S&amp;OP Lead
Accountable (A): S&amp;OP Lead
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3912_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3912_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3912_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3912_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3912_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-610 (ensure controlled execution — S&amp;OP/IBP Framework, Demand Consensus &amp; Forecasting (PA-127.1).) | - operational: explicit gap-closing options and exec decision; operational: margin-aware gap-closing
Owner: S&amp;OP / Demand Planning</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
